+| `git diff --check` | 0 | `git-diff-check.log` |
+| byte comparison against all CR revision-4 paths | 0 | No mismatches |
+| `curator install` | 0 | `curator-install.log` |
+| `curator status --check` after install | 0 | `curator-status-rerun.log` |
